// P3G.5 ex-dv1 (derived-and-linking.md ex-dv1, DV3.1–DV3.3; derived-and-linking-gaps.md "What
// each exercise needs"): document B derives A's 50 × 30 × 25 block at the origin and at a mate
// connector at (0, 0, 100). Stand-ins: `fixtures/linked_block_standin.cadrs` (A "Block source",
// the Part Studio "Block" with "Mate connector 1" on its top face, V1, in the folder "Linked
// parts") and `fixtures/linked_block_host_standin.cadrs` (B "Block derived": "Part Studio 1"
// with "Mate connector 1" at (0, 0, 100)).
// 01 B's Part Studio 1: its Mate connector 1 at (0, 0, 100); the icon rail's Insert hovered.
// 02 Derived 1's dialog: Other documents › Linked parts › Block source (V1): "Block" hovered.
// 03 Block picked: the source card "Block · Block source · V1"; Derive: Part Studio; Locations
//    empty (the origin): one copy where it is in A.
// 04 Locations: the Origin and Mate connector 1 picked in the Feature list: two copies, at
//    z 0..25 and 100..125.
// 05 ✓, both copies selected, Mass properties: 2 × 37 500 = 75 000 mm³, 2 × 7 000 = 14 000 mm²,
//    centroid (25, 15, 62.5): the source's 12.5 + 50 (the self-check).
// 06 (a P3G.4 minor) Derived 1 edited, Placement Base origin, **Include mate connectors** on:
//    the derived "Mate connector 1" on each copy's top face, at (25, 15, 25) and (25, 15, 125),
//    away from B's own Mate connector 1 at (0, 0, 100).
// 07 ✓: Derived 1 open in the Feature list: its parts, sketch and the two derived connectors.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Custom("linked-fixture store linked_block_standin folder"),
        Custom("linked-fixture open linked_block_host_standin"),
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Key("F"),
        Hover(ui("rail-insert")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("01-host-rail-insert"),
        Click(ui("rail-insert")),
        WaitFor("derived-dialog"),
        Click(ui("derived-source-tabs-1")),
        WaitFor("derived-other-loc-folder-linked-parts"),
        Click(ui("derived-other-loc-folder-linked-parts")),
        Click(ui("derived-other-doc-block-source")),
        Hover(ui("derived-studio-block")),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("02-block-source-v1"),
        Click(ui("derived-studio-block")),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03-source-picked"),
        Click(ui("derived-locations")),
        Click(ui("feature-origin")),
        Click(ui("feature-mate-connector-1")),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-two-locations"),
        Click(ui("derived-dialog-accept")),
        Click(ui("part-row-part-1")),
        Click(ui("part-row-part-1--2")),
        Click(ui("view-mass")),
        WaitFor("mass-dialog"),
        ExpectText("mass-dialog", "75000.000"),
        ExpectText("mass-dialog", "14000.000"),
        ExpectText("mass-dialog", "62.500"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("05-two-copies-mass"),
        Click(ui("mass-dialog-cancel")),
        Key("Space"),
        Wait(5),
        DoubleClick(ui("feature-derived-1")),
        WaitFor("derived-dialog"),
        Click(ui("derived-include-connectors-checkbox")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("06-base-origin-include-connectors"),
        Click(ui("derived-dialog-accept")),
        Click(ui("feature-derived-1-chevron")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("07-derived-children"),
    ],
)
